When converting from .e2m3x2/.e3m2x2 to .f16x2, source operand a has .b16 type. Each 8-bit
input value with 2 MSB bits 0 in operand a is converted to .f16 type. The converted values are packed
in the destination operand d such that the value converted from the upper 8 bits of a is stored in the
